Package: soundsausage
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rene Timmermans <rtimmermans@infodatek.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-numpy, python3-pyside6.qtcore (>= 6.8), python3-pyside6.qtgui (>= 6.8), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets (>= 6.8), qt6-qpa-plugins, ffmpeg, libc6 (>= 2.41), libstdc++6
Homepage: https://github.com/rene-timmermans/SoundSausage
Description: Waveform and multitrack audio editor
 Edit WAV recordings, mix audio tracks and apply amplitude effects.
 Includes channel mixing, dynamics processing and editable volume envelopes.
